BOM (Browser Object Model) ?

BOM represnents additional objects provided by the browser to work with everything outside the document.

    EX: window, navigation, location, history, screen, alert(), confirm(), etc.

  ¦----------------------------------------------------------------¦
  ¦   Object      ¦               Use                              ¦         
  ¦----------------------------------------------------------------¦
  ¦   window      ¦   Global object, represnents browser window    ¦
  ¦   navigation  ¦   Info about browser & OS                      ¦ 
  ¦   location    ¦   URL related info & navigation                ¦ 
  ¦   history     ¦   Browser history (back, forword)              ¦ 
  ¦   screen      ¦   screen related info                          ¦ 
